@startuml uc006-analysis-sequence
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-006 Run complete evaluation: analysis sequence (main success scenario)

boundary "Command Line" as CLI
control "Run Evaluation" as Run
boundary "Config File" as CF
boundary "Model Interface" as MI
entity "Evaluation Run" as ER
entity "Case Result" as CR
boundary "Report Store" as RS

CLI -> Run : run(config file, output directory?)
Run -> CF : read config
CF --> Run : evaluation config (profiles, dataset, rubric id, output)
Run -> Run : load benchmark, look up rubric,\nopen target and judge connections (UC-001, UC-002)
Run -> CLI : show benchmark, target, judge and rubric
Run -> ER : start(now)
loop each test case, in order
  Run -> MI : ask the target the question (UC-003)
  MI --> Run : answer
  Run -> MI : ask the judge for a verdict (UC-004)
  MI --> Run : verdict
  Run -> CR : create(case, outcome = verdict, evidence)
  Run -> CLI : show progress line (case evaluated)
end
Run -> ER : finish(now)
Run -> Run : summarise and build the report (UC-005)
Run -> RS : write report
RS --> Run : report path
Run -> CLI : show totals, pass rate with coverage, report path
CLI -> CLI : exit code 0

note right of MI
  Extensions 3a, 4a: a failed or cut-off answer is not judged;
  a judge failure is ERROR at the judge stage, never FAIL.
  An auth or quota failure stops the rest of that stage.
end note
@enduml
